# The API this client talks to in a production build. Vercel's own environment variables
# win over this file, so a value set on the project overrides what is committed here.
#
# It is committed because the address is public information -- the browser sends it in
# every request -- and because the URL is baked into the bundle at build time: an
# incorrect value here fails silently as a sign-in that never completes, which is harder
# to diagnose than one line in the repository.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://digital-wallet-payment-system.onrender.com
